Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-rtmidi, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtcore
Description: native controller for Yamaha AG06MK2 / AG03MK2 mixers
 Controls the hardware switches (CH1/CH2 effect send, CH1 COMP/EQ, CH2 AMP SIM),
 the assignable foot switch and shows live level meters over the mixer's USB
 MIDI port. Includes a command-line tool (agctl) and a desktop app (agctl-gui).
